Farrow Cross is the High Arbiter of [[Org/The Scale/index|the Scale]], the head of the organization. She is one of the known hierophants, the card of Justice in the harrow decks: pulling her means the truth will be revealed, for better or worse.

In [[Sigzil Haight]]'s demesne, Scale delvers found two fiends at their desks writing and revising stories about an invasion of the Scale. Cross appeared in both as the central figure, fighting the invaders; in each rewrite more of the Scale died and the invasion went further.
